@startuml
!theme sys-flat from ../themes
title Order request timing

robust "Web app" as Web
concise "OrderService" as Svc
robust "Database" as DB

@0
Web is Idle
Svc is Idle
DB is Idle

@100
Web is Handling
Svc is Creating

@180
DB is Writing

@260
DB is Idle
Svc is Publishing

@320
Svc is Idle
Web is Idle
@enduml
